2606.13380,2606.13380,"11,12",cross_page,"According to the evaluation, for which molecules and at what bond lengths did the generated ansatz outperform UCCSD and achieve chemical accuracy?","For larger bond lengths of BeH2, H2O, and N2, the generated ansatz outperformed UCCSD and achieved chemical accuracy.","As shown on the right side of Fig. 4, the gener- ated ansatz maintains chemical accuracy (≤1.6 × 10−3 Hartree) across almost all molecules, except for certain stretched configurations of H6 and N2.","However, it exhibited competitive performance for the other molecules. In addition, for larger bond lengths of BeH2, H2O and N2, the generated ansatz outper- formed UCCSD and achieved chemical accuracy.","PAGE A provides the definition of chemical accuracy and the context of the ansatz's performance, while PAGE B specifies the molecules and bond lengths where the generated ansatz outperformed UCCSD and achieved chemical accuracy.",reject,multihop-v1,0.000,1.000,"single_page_sufficient(page_B,f1=1.00)"
